###

### Get all veiculos
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get veiculo by ID
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get veiculos por placa (filtro)
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos?placa=ABC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create veiculo
POST {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clienteId": 1,
    "placa": "ABC1234",
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "modelo": "Corolla",
    "ano": 2020
}

###

### Update veiculo
PUT {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Honda",
    "modelo": "Civic"
}

###

### Soft delete (inativar)
DELETE {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/veiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}